# Gemini rewrites the prose of a corrected tender. It never decides which
# standard applies, whether one is withdrawn, or what replaces it — the
# register settles all of that before the model is called, and the model's
# output is audited again afterwards. Without a key the repair still runs,
# deterministically; the document just reads less smoothly.
#
# Copy this file to .env and put your key in it. .env is gitignored.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
